{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-checked seed for title reading. build_title_lexicon.py merges this with LLM-verified entries",
    "(accepted.jsonl) into orchestrator/title_lexicon.json; the seed wins every conflict.",
    "levels x tables are composed at runtime: S. + Kom -> S.Kom. = Sarjana Komputer / Bachelor of Computer Science.",
    "Field codes with capitals only (KM, IP) also match dotted (K.M.) and dotless (SKM) writing.",
    "post/pre: explicit titles. letters = which alphabet the short reading uses (id/en).",
    "short = override for TITLE_POST_MODE=short. id = null means there is no good full reading: always short.",
    "chain_only_dotless: dotless form only counts after another title (CA = California, MD = Maryland).",
    "initial: a one-letter pre title (H.) that could be a name initial; dot_required: no dotless form.",
    "chain_only: a pre title that only counts after another pre title (R. = Raden in 'Prof. Ir. R. Soemadijo', an initial elsewhere)."
  ],
